  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "同样是发数据，为什么视频卡一下照样看，转账少一分都不行？",
      "audio": "s01.mp3",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 5.867,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 176
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "因为网络世界里有两套快递系统，TCP和UDP。",
      "audio": "s02.mp3",
      "start_sec": 6.047,
      "end_sec": 11.097,
      "start_frame": 181,
      "end_frame": 333
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "TCP像打电话：先拨号，确认你在线，才开始说，这叫三次握手。",
      "audio": "s03.mp3",
      "start_sec": 11.277,
      "end_sec": 17.817,
      "start_frame": 338,
      "end_frame": 535
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "每个包都编号签收，丢了就重发，稳，但慢一点。",
      "audio": "s04.mp3",
      "start_sec": 17.997,
      "end_sec": 22.674,
      "start_frame": 540,
      "end_frame": 680
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "UDP像拿大喇叭喊话：喊完就走，不管你听没听到。",
      "audio": "s05.mp3",
      "start_sec": 22.854,
      "end_sec": 27.832,
      "start_frame": 686,
      "end_frame": 835
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "快是真快，丢了你也不知道。",
      "audio": "s06.mp3",
      "start_sec": 28.012,
      "end_sec": 30.778,
      "start_frame": 840,
      "end_frame": 923
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "所以网页、文件、登录，走TCP；直播、游戏、DNS，走UDP。",
      "audio": "s07.mp3",
      "start_sec": 30.958,
      "end_sec": 38.64,
      "start_frame": 929,
      "end_frame": 1159
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "记住一句话：TCP要确认，UDP只要快。",
      "audio": "s08.mp3",
      "start_sec": 38.82,
      "end_sec": 43.149,
      "start_frame": 1165,
      "end_frame": 1294
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "学会了就点个赞点个关注，下期拆三次握手到底在握什么。",
      "audio": "s09.mp3",
      "start_sec": 43.329,
      "end_sec": 48.896,
      "start_frame": 1300,
      "end_frame": 1467
    }
  ]
}